  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>'<p>Push through your limits in classy comfort and heritage style with the Nike Vomero 17. Crafted with a new engineered mesh upper, these shoes offer a breathable fit and a relaxed feel for everyday runs. The plush tongue and lining ensure a snug feel. The new stacked dual-density midsole featuring premium ZoomX underfoot and Cushlon 3.0 foam delivers maximum underfoot comfort and snappy response to get more out of your run. Raise the bar with the Nike Vomero 17 and chase your running goals in style.</p> <ul> <li>Heel-to-toe drop: 10 mm.</li> <li>Redesigned waffle-inspired outsole with breakpoints ensures a sturdy, flexible stride.</li> </ul><hr /><p>Daily miles feel smoother when comfort and response stay in balance. Built for everything from easy runs to long walks, the Nike Vomero 17 delivers a plush, stable ride with breathable support up top and a soft, springy feel underfoot that helps take the edge off hard pavement.</p><ul><li>Engineered mesh upper for breathable comfort.</li><li>Plush tongue and lining for a soft, secure feel.</li><li>Dual-density midsole combines ZoomX foam and Cushlon 3.0 foam for cushioned response.</li><li>Redesigned waffle-inspired outsole with flex grooves for grip and smoother transitions.</li><li>10 mm heel-to-toe drop.</li></ul>  <p><strong>Size &amp; Fit Guidance</strong></p><p>Most reviewers say the fit feels true to size, with a secure hold through the midfoot and a toe box that feels roomier than many Nike runners. For the best fit, we recommend starting with your usual size; if you prefer extra forefoot room or wear thicker socks, a half-size up may feel better.</p>  <p><strong>Best For</strong></p><p>Best for runners and walkers who want a cushioned daily trainer that can handle easy miles, longer sessions, treadmill runs, and long hours on their feet.</p>  <p><strong>Cushioning &amp; Road Feel</strong></p><p>Reviewers consistently describe the ride as plush from heel to toe, with enough bounce to keep transitions smooth without feeling overly soft. The result is a protective road feel that stays comfortable on pavement while still feeling steady for everyday training.</p>  <p><strong>Break-In &amp; Durability</strong></p><p>Many runners say the Vomero 17 feels comfortable right out of the box, with little to no break-in needed. Reviewers who have logged regular mileage often call out dependable traction and cushioning that holds up well over time.</p>  <p><strong>Care &amp; Maintenance</strong></p><p>Spot clean the mesh upper with a soft brush or cloth and let the shoes air dry to help preserve the finish. Reviewers also note the outsole tread cleans up easily after regular road use.</p>\"</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike Vomero 17 - Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Black/White/Anthracite</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - B - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Breathable mesh upper with durable synthetic overlays and rubber traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>FB8502-001</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<det